# PR Body Response Format

When the user asks for a pull request body, return it as raw Markdown inside a single inline code block so it can be copied directly.

- Do not add commentary before or after the code block unless the user asks for explanation.
- Keep standard PR sections when relevant (for example: Summary, Testing, Notes).
- Ensure the output is valid Markdown text exactly as it should appear in the PR description.
